  provenance: "AUTHORED 2026-10-29 from SIX's picks in the training interview (TRAINING-CONCEPT
    M21\u2013M28; all eight recommended options). Respawn (M26, Air Wing W59): respawnDelayS
    3 (a fall from 6,000 ft takes about 30 s, wasted in training), protectionS 5
    (can't be hit and can't fire: against spawn camping, which a learner finds).
    Jitter (M25): jitterHeightM 300, jitterHeadingDeg 15, seed 2026, so the brain
    never learns one start. Collisions (W60): collisionM 15, about the F/A-18E's
    13.6 m span plus a margin. The box (W61): centred on the merge midway between
    the spawn points 20 km apart, (0, 12,000), half-widths 20 km: 40 \xD7 40 km."
